    {
      "id": "dcbcc8dd-8be0-527c-b794-bbdea68ab9c3",
      "name": "Claude triage",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        1680,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You help the procurement team of a Spanish public hospital understand why a tender lot received no bids\n(it was declared deserted) and who should act. Write in {{ $('Config').first().json.language }}.\nUse ONLY the facts below. If the facts don't support a reason, say \"unclear\". No legal advice.\nName the lot by what it buys, never by its ref code.\n\nTender: {{ $json.title }}\nLots declared deserted in this tender: {{ $json.lots }} (total budget EUR, rounded: {{ $json.budget || 'unknown' }})\nCPV (4 digits): {{ $json.cpv4 }} | Procedure code: {{ $json.procedure }}\nDeclared deserted: {{ $json.deserted_date }} | What happened next: {{ $json.outcome }}{{ $json.republished_title ? ' – republished as: ' + $json.republished_title : '' }}\nMarket for this CPV at other Spanish health buyers: {{ $json.market_n ?? '?' }} open lots, median {{ $json.market_median_bids ?? '?' }} bids, {{ $json.market_single_bid_rate != null ? Math.round($json.market_single_bid_rate * 100) + ' %' : '?' }} single-bid\n\nClassify with these rules (from the hospital's own competition analysis):\n- structural: no clause would change it. Signals: the market is one supplier everywhere (single-bid share >= 80 %),\n  the manufacturer services its own machine, a patented medicine named by active principle, stated exclusivity.\n- earlier_decision: competition was decided before this tender. Signals: consumables or maintenance tied to\n  installed equipment (\"instalado en\", \"compatible con\", \"del equipo\", a brand name), a framework call-off, an extension.\n- addressable: nothing structural; a lever is worth trying. Signals: other buyers get several bids for the same\n  CPV (single-bid share < 50 %), a thin market (50-80 %), a very large lot (> EUR 500,000), a service contract.\n- unclear: the facts above don't support any of these.\n\nPick ONE lever, in Spanish, from: \"consulta preliminar de mercado (art. 115)\", \"dividir en lotes\",\n\"ampliar el plazo de presentación de ofertas\", \"revisar el presupuesto con el servicio promotor\",\n\"verificar la exclusividad técnica (art. 168) y valorar procedimiento negociado\",\n\"cláusula «o equivalente» en la próxima compra de equipo\", \"actuar en la renovación del acuerdo marco\",\n\"confirmar con el servicio si la necesidad sigue\".\n\nReply with ONLY one JSON object, no code fence, no text before or after. Inside values use single quotes, never double quotes:\n{\"bucket\": \"structural|earlier_decision|addressable|unclear\", \"signals\": \"the 1-3 facts that decided it\",\n \"lever\": \"one lever from the list\", \"headline\": \"max 15 words\", \"why\": \"two sentences from the facts above\",\n \"confidence\": \"high|medium|low\"}",
        "hasOutputParser": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "62e509a2-f222-5a2a-a06d-4a73d82bf68a",
      "name": "Claude",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.6,
      "position": [
        1660,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "claude-sonnet-5-5"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2,
          "maxTokensToSample": 1024
        }
      }
